## Testing Patterns

### Testing Endpoints

```bash
# Local testing
bun run dev

# Test with curl
curl "http://localhost:8787/api/events?sport=NFL&limit=10"

# Test with validation error
curl "http://localhost:8787/api/events?limit=9999"
```

### Testing Validation

```typescript
import { validateInput, Validators } from './validation';

const result = validateInput({ agentID: 'test_123' }, [
  Validators.agentID(true)
]);

expect(result.valid).toBe(true);
expect(result.sanitized.agentID).toBe('test_123');
```

